# Documentation in English

Write all project documentation and code comments in English.

This covers:

- Code comments and docstrings
- README, changelog, and other docs in the repository
- Names and descriptions inside documentation files

Chat replies to the user stay in the language they are using. Only repository documentation and comments are in English.

```lua
-- ❌ BAD
-- Aumenta a velocidade da esteira quando a pesquisa termina.

-- ✅ GOOD
-- Increases belt speed when the research finishes.
```

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
## Como publicar

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
## How to publish
```
